      "title": "Australia news live: Greens leader David Shoebridge says he didn’t expect Larissa Waters departure; inflation climbs to 4% in year to August",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/sep/30/labor-anthony-albanese-coalition-polling-new-greens-leader-openai-hack-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Follow the day’s news live</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p><strong>Who is potential Greens deputy leader candidate Steph Hodgins-May?</strong></p><p>So who is the first-term senator expected to announce a leadership ticket tilt with <strong>David Shoebridge</strong>?</p><p>Get your dirty hands off our kids, that is our message to the fossil fuel industry, who have no place in early-learning centres, in schools, or in our cultural institutions in this country.</p><p>Children should go to school to get evidence-based education, not to be brainwashed by fossil fuel corporations seeking to build social licence.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/sep/30/labor-anthony-albanese-coalition-polling-new-greens-leader-openai-hack-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-30T02:38:32"
    },
    {
      "title": "David Shoebridge elected new Greens leader after pledging to ‘replace’ Labor",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/30/david-shoebridge-greens-leadership-steph-hodgins-may-retreat-larissa-waters",
      "description": "<p>Shoebridge, a senator from New South Wales and former upper house state MP, won the role over Mehreen Faruqi and Sarah Hanson-Young </p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/sep/30/labor-anthony-albanese-coalition-polling-new-greens-leader-openai-hack-ntwnfb\">Follow our Australia news live blog for latest updates</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">new political email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>David Shoebridge has been named the new federal leader of the Greens, with Steph Hodgins-May as his deputy, Guardian Australia understands.</p><p>The Greens will make a formal announcement in Sydney shortly.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/30/david-shoebridge-greens-leadership-steph-hodgins-may-retreat-larissa-waters\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-30T02:04:17"
    },
    {
      "title": "An EV sold every 100 seconds: Australian demand for electric cars more than doubles",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2026/sep/30/australia-electric-cars-vehichles-ev-sales-double",
      "description": "<p>A record 157,957 new EVs were sold nationally between January and June, according to the Electric Vehicle Council</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/sep/30/labor-anthony-albanese-coalition-polling-new-greens-leader-openai-hack-ntwnfb\">Follow our Australia news live blog for latest updates</a></p></li><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Australians are buying electric vehicles at record levels, with sales more than doubling year on year and occurring at a rate equivalent to one EV sold every 100 seconds.</p><p>A record 157,957 EV sales occurred between January and June – an 117% increase on the same period last year, according to a new report released by the Electric Vehicle Council.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2026/sep/30/australia-electric-cars-vehichles-ev-sales-double\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-09-30T02:02:20"
    }
